  "reflectionQuestion": "They hung the harps on the willows. The captors asked for songs. One man said: how shall we sing the LORD's song in a strange land? Then he made a vow not to forget Jerusalem. What is it to be asked to sing the songs of your home in a country where you cannot make yourself sing them?",
  "reflectionText": "They hanged the harps upon the willows. The captors required of them songs. One man said: how shall we sing the LORD's song in a strange land? Then he made a vow not to forget Jerusalem. What is it to be required to sing the songs of thine home in a land where thou canst not bring thyself to sing them?",
